          "id": "103918"
        },
        "body": "Made a fork of the nspawn plugin since that is tonic already for reproduction: https://codeberg.org/mafrw/runner-systemd-nspawn\r\nAdded to the runner config:\r\n```yaml\r\nplugins:\r\n  systemd-nspawn:\r\n    address: unix:///tmp/nspawn-plugin.sock\r\n```\r\nDownloaded the latest runner binary release, connected it to the forgejo test instance and created a workflow that depends on that backend\r\n```yaml\r\nname: helloworld\r\n\r\non:\r\n  workflow_dispatch:\r\n  push:\r\n\r\njobs:\r\n  hello:\r\n    name: hello\r\n    runs-on: nspawn-fedora-44\r\n    steps:\r\n      - run: echo Hello World!\r\n```\r\nGives us the error mentioned above\r\n```\r\nRunner e6730f12-c52a-478d-9cf4-f962a5d2a4a3 (version:v13.2.0) received task 2651 of job hello, triggered by event: workflow_dispatch\r\nworkflow prepared\r\n🔌 Connecting to plugin systemd-nspawn at unix:///tmp/nspawn-plugin.sock\r\nplugin systemd-nspawn: health check plugin at passthrough:////tmp/nspawn-plugin.sock: rpc error: code = Internal desc = stream terminated by RST_STREAM with error code: PROTOCOL_ERROR\r\n```"
      },
