            "number": "1777"
          },
          "id": "103322"
        },
        "body": "This case seems to be the equivalent of `github.event.inputs.image == \"option1\" ||  github.event.inputs.image == \"option2\"`, without a matrix, since the both jobs of the matrix are never run.  Alternatively, it could be similar to a reusable workflow where `github.event.inputs.name` is used as an input.\r\n\r\nIt's a little hard to tell from this cut-down sample what you're trying to accomplish.  I agree with @aahlenst's analysis that the problem is trying to use a value that isn't available in `if`.  Instead of just providing a reproduction, can you describe what you are trying to accomplish?  We may be able to help more in providing a useful direction."
      },
